@startuml Pause Resume
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

title Pause, maintain, and resume compensation
participant PHD2EventServer
participant PHD2Client
participant ViewModel
participant MountController
participant TrendEstimator

PHD2EventServer -> PHD2Client: Settling or Paused event
activate PHD2Client
PHD2Client -> ViewModel: _on_settling() / _on_paused()
activate ViewModel
ViewModel -> ViewModel: paused = true
deactivate ViewModel
deactivate PHD2Client
note right: Existing trend window is retained.

PHD2Client -> ViewModel: GuideStep during pause
activate PHD2Client
activate ViewModel
ViewModel -> MountController: get_declination()
activate MountController
MountController --> ViewModel: declination
deactivate MountController
ViewModel -> ViewModel: log raw guide step only
ViewModel -> TrendEstimator: no new sample
deactivate ViewModel
PHD2Client --> PHD2Client: GuideStep handled
deactivate PHD2Client

loop maintenance polling while paused
    ViewModel -> ViewModel: _maintain_tick()
    activate ViewModel
    ViewModel -> MountController: get_tracking()
    activate MountController
    MountController --> ViewModel: tracking state
    deactivate MountController
    ViewModel -> MountController: get_side_of_pier()
    activate MountController
    MountController --> ViewModel: pier side
    deactivate MountController
    ViewModel -> MountController: set_ra_rate(current_offset, dry_run)
    activate MountController
    MountController --> ViewModel: offset maintained
    deactivate MountController
    ViewModel --> ViewModel: maintenance tick complete
    deactivate ViewModel
end

PHD2EventServer -> PHD2Client: SettleDone or Resumed event
activate PHD2Client
PHD2Client -> ViewModel: _on_settle_done() / _on_resumed()
activate ViewModel
ViewModel -> ViewModel: paused = false
deactivate ViewModel
deactivate PHD2Client
PHD2Client -> ViewModel: next GuideStep
activate ViewModel
ViewModel -> TrendEstimator: add_sample()
activate TrendEstimator
TrendEstimator --> ViewModel: sample accepted
deactivate TrendEstimator
deactivate ViewModel
@enduml
